line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">## Description</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">Two parts of one theorem share a node; the second declaration deliberately starts with eq_.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">namespace</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Fixture2000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/-- **Theorem 1** (Fixture2000). Apply Lemma 2 to the distinguished degree. -/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">theorem</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> degree_add_zero</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (c : ChainComplexToy) : c.degree + </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> = c.degree := </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">by</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exact add_zero_natural c.degree</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/-- **Theorem 1 (ii)** (Fixture2000). Substitute the assumed zero degree in part (i). -/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">theorem</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> eq_degree_zero</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (c : ChainComplexToy) (h : c.degree = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) : c.degree + </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> := </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">by</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exact (degree_add_zero c).trans h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">end</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Fixture2000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>",
    "source_text": "import HomAlg.Fixture2000.Def_1\nimport HomAlg.Fixture2000.Lem_2\n\n/-!\n```yaml node\n{\n  \"id\": \"Fixture2000.Thm_1\",\n  \"kind\": \"theorem\",\n  \"doc\": \"Fixture2000\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"chapter\": \"1\",\n    \"section\": \"1.1\",\n    \"label\": \"Theorem 1\",\n    \"pages\": [\n      2\n    ]\n  },\n  \"title\": \"Theorem 1\",\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"chain-complex\",\n    \"basic\"\n  ],\n  \"concepts\": {\n    \"defines\": [],\n    \"uses\": []\n  },\n  \"deps\": {\n    \"statement\": [\n      \"Fixture2000.Def_1\"\n    ],\n    \"proof\": [\"Fixture2000.Lem_2\"]\n  },\n  \"decls\": [\n    \"Fixture2000.degree_add_zero\",\n    \"Fixture2000.eq_degree_zero\"\n  ],\n  \"fidelity\": {\n    \"status\": \"faithful\"\n  },\n  \"nl_proof_source\": {\n    \"follows\": \"document\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Statement\n\nFor every toy chain complex $C$, $\\deg C+0=\\deg C$. If $\\deg C=0$, then $\\deg C+0=0$.\n\n## Proof\n\nApply Lemma 2 to the degree, proving the first assertion. [uses `Fixture2000.Lem_2`] Substitute the assumed equality into that assertion to obtain the second.\n\n## Description\n\nTwo parts of one theorem share a node; the second declaration deliberately starts with eq_.\n-/\n\nnamespace Fixture2000\n\n/-- **Theorem 1** (Fixture2000). Apply Lemma 2 to the distinguished degree. -/\ntheorem degree_add_zero (c : ChainComplexToy) : c.degree + 0 = c.degree := by\n  exact add_zero_natural c.degree\n\n/-- **Theorem 1 (ii)** (Fixture2000). Substitute the assumed zero degree in part (i). -/\ntheorem eq_degree_zero (c : ChainComplexToy) (h : c.degree = 0) : c.degree + 0 = 0 := by\n  exact (degree_add_zero c).trans h\n\nend Fixture2000\n"
